      "side": 1,
      "message": "While I am for this direction / purpose of change, I think this specific way going about it is somewhat lacking. Using environment variable this way effectively implements a secret handshake. I would prefer that it is done via adding a command-line switch, with suitable default one way or the other, and that the command-line switch itself is self-documented if you supplied the wrong arguments, or suggested usage being shown when invoked with \"--help\", etc. I just think using environment variables this way is poor design.",
